  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0428.medeia.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0428.medeia.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0428.medeia.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0428_medeia"><head>ΜΗΔΕΙΑ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" xml:id="kock-0428-medeia-1" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0428_medeia">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0428-medeia-1-l1" xml:lang="grc">κιθαρῳδὸν ἐξηγείρατ’ Ἀράβιον χορόν.</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Suidas Ἀράβιος ἄγγελος . . . καὶ Ἀράβιος αὐλητὴς ἐπὶ τῶν ἀκαταπαύστων. Κάνθαρος Μηδείᾳ κτλ. cf. Apostol. 3, 71. Steph. Byz. Ἀραβία. Dionys. Perieg. 939. Zenob. 2, 39. 58. χορὸν Bernhardy]</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" xml:id="kock-0428-medeia-2" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0428_medeia">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0428-medeia-2-l1" xml:lang="grc">βαρύσταθμον</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Κάνθαρος Μηδείᾳ. Bekker. Anecd. 85, 30. cf. Aristoph. Ran. 1397.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" xml:id="kock-0428-medeia-3" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0428_medeia">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0428-medeia-3-l1" xml:lang="grc">βαυβήσομεν</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Bekker. Anecd. 85, 10 βαυβᾶν· ἀντὶ τοῦ καθεύδειν . . . Κάνθαρος Μηδείᾳ. cod. βαβᾶν, βαβήσομεν. cf. Cratin. 312.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" xml:id="kock-0428-medeia-4" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0428_medeia">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0428-medeia-4-l1" xml:lang="grc">ἐλᾶν</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">ἀντὶ τοῦ ἐλαύνειν. Κάνθαρος Μηδείᾳ. Bekker. Anecd. 97, 10.</note>
